    <data key="d0">Social Quantum Mobile Game Serverless Architecture</data>
    <data key="d1">https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=fSV0u48sEVg</data>
    <data key="d2">Architecture for Social Quantum mobile games processing 60k requests/min using ECS Fargate, RDS, ElastiCache, Lambda, and CloudWatch.</data>
